# an out of range integer for an option with only a long name
program OneName
arg --number=11
status 2
output
Error: Value out of range for option --number.
onename [options]

  -t <arg>
      String option with short name only.
  --text <arg>
      String option with long name only.
  -n <arg>
      Integer option with short name only.
  --number <arg>
      Integer option with long name only.
Terminated by Halt(1). 
